\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field--item\"><div class=\"image-with-credit\"> <div class=\"attribution\"> <a href=\"/media/kilauea-point-peninsula\">Image Details</a></div></div></div><div class=\"deck-slide\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field--item\">The Kīlauea Point peninsula stands 180-feet above sea level</div></div></div></div><div class=\"field--item\"><div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--slide paragraph--view-mode--default\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field--item\"><div class=\"image-with-credit\"> <div class=\"attribution\"> <a href=\"/media/red-tailed-tropic-courting-kilauea-point-national-wildlife-refuge\">Image Details</a></div></div></div><div class=\"deck-slide\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field--item\">Red-tailed tropic courting at Kīlauea Point National Wildlife Refuge</div></div></div></div><div class=\"field--item\"><div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--slide paragraph--view-mode--default\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field--item\"><div class=\"image-with-credit\"> <div class=\"attribution\"> <a href=\"/media/red-footed-booby-3\">Image Details</a></div></div></div><div class=\"deck-slide\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field--item\">Kīlauea Point is home to one of the largest colonies of red-footed boobies (ā) in the world.</div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div></div></div><div role=\"main\" class=\"main-container container js-quickedit-main-content\" id=\"main-content\"><div class=\"row m-0\"><div class=\"col-sm-12\"><div class=\"region region-header\"></div></div> <aside class=\"col-sidebar\" role=\"complementary\"><div class=\"region region-sidebar-first\"> <section id=\"bl