ational Public Lands Day</li><li>Saturday, October 18, 2025: National Wildlife Refuge Week</li><li>Saturday, November 8, 2025: In honor of Veterans Day</li><li>Saturday, January 17, 2026: In honor of Martin Luther King Jr. Day</li><li>Saturday, May 2, 2026: Lighthouse Day</li><li>Friday, June 19, 2026: Juneteenth</li><li>Saturday, September 26, 2026: National Public Lands Day</li><li>Saturday, October 17: National Wildlife Refuge Week</li></ul><h6>Holiday Closures</h6><ul></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"block block-fws-search block-fws-search-appfacility-events clearfix\"><div class=\"block-container\"><div class=\"fws-search-app\"><fws-search-app></fws-search-app></div></div></section></div></div></div></article></div> </section></div></div> </div></body></html>"
